+/*                                                                         */
+/*    Support functions for X11.                                           */
+/*                                                                         */
+/*  Copyright 2002-2004, 2006, 2007, 2013 by                               */
+/*  David Turner, Robert Wilhelm, and Werner Lemberg.                      */
