+  /*                        registered modules. Note that each font driver */
+  /*                        contains a list of its opened faces.           */
+  /*                                                                       */
+  /*    renderers        :: The list of renderers currently registered     */
+  /*                        within the library.                            */
+  /*                                                                       */
